WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.270
- WHAT ARE WE DOING
IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD?

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.706
- COME ON, THIS PLACE
IS IN OUR PRICE RANGE.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.408
BESIDES, I MEAN,
PEOPLE SAY THE NEIGHBORHOOD'S

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:12.379
TURNING AROUND.
- WHO THE [bleep] THERE!

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.913
IT'S JORDAN AND KEIRA.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.052
WE'RE HERE TO VIEW
THE APARTMENT AT 3:00.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:22.422
- [laughs]
OH [bleep], MY BAD.

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:25.091
I HAD THIS HOMELESS CRACKHEAD
TRYING TO SET UP HOUSE

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:28.294
IN HERE YESTERDAY.
ALMOST HAD TO BEAT HIS ASS, MAN.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.829
BUT Y'ALL AIN'T GOT
NOTHING TO WORRY ABOUT,

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:31.364
'CAUSE ANYBODY
TRY TO GET UP IN HERE,

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.566
I WILL MURDER THEM.

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.435
LET ME GIVE
Y'ALL THE TOUR.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.537
ALL RIGHT, SO WE GOT
THESE VINTAGE WINDOWS.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.606
THEY BEEN HERE AS LONG AS
THE BUILDING'S BEEN HERE.

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.441
[car approaching]
OH [bleep]!

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:42.909
GET AWAY FROM THE WINDOW!
GET AWAY FROM THE WINDOW!

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.811
HEY! HEY!

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.880
YOU, [bleep]!
I SEE YOU OUT THERE!

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.416
YOU GET OUT THAT CAR,
AND I WILL MURDER YOU!

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:50.450
[engine revving,
tires squeal]

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:51.885
THAT'S WHAT I THOUGHT!

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.720
SO ROLL ON,
YOU LITTLE [bleep]!

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.723
ROLL ON!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.992
MY NEPHEW, CRAIG.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.361
HE A GOOD KID.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.731
HE SMOKE CRACK, THOUGH.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.833
GO AHEAD AND...

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.568
JUST, UH, JUST IN CASE
HE COME BACK.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.103
- UH...
- AND I FILED THE SERIAL NUMBER

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.671
OFF THAT,
SO IF YOU GOTTA SHOOT ANYBODY,

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.273
JUST MAKE SURE
TO WIPE YOUR FINGERPRINTS

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.842
OFF THIS [bleep].

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:18.778
WELL, COME ON, Y'ALL.
I AIN'T GONNA BITE YOU.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.880
BRAND-NEW CUPBOARDS.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:22.949
I PUT THE CONTACT PAPER
IN MYSELF HERE

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.684
SO Y'ALL DON'T GET NO GERMS.
[car approaching]

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:25.952
GET DOWN!

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:31.357
[hip-hop music playing outside]

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.093
NAH, AIN'T NO THING.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.462
I THOUGHT CRAIG
WAS ROLLING BACK.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.964
I AIN'T GETTING SHOT
BY THIS [bleep] TWICE, DAMN.

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:39.332
WHILE WE DOWN HERE,

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.301
CHECK THIS OUT.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.735
ORIGINAL HARDWOOD FLOOR

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.337
FROM WHEN THE BUILDING
WAS BUILT.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.473
CHECK OUT
THIS GRAIN, BROTHER.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.741
WHOO!
THAT IS CRAFTSMANSHIP!

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:49.642
ANYWAY, COME ON.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:53.012
[grunting]

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:56.683
NOW, THIS PAINT
IS ALL NEW, AND--

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.452
AW [bleep].

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.055
OKAY, THIS--THIS HAPPENED
AFTER I HAD PAINTED.

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.691
FUNNY STORY, WE GOT CRACKHEADS
IN THIS NEIGHBORHOOD,

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:07.127
AND ONE OF THEM LIVED
RIGHT NEXT DOOR HERE, RIGHT?

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.662
AND ONE DAY, HE WAS SMOKING
CRACK, JUST WENT LOONEY TUNES

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:11.898
AND MISTOOK HIS 9MM--

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:13.900
THAT'S A PISTOL, HONEY--
FOR THE REMOTE CONTROL.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.035
BUT DON'T WORRY, YOU AIN'T
NEVER GONNA SEE HIM AGAIN.

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:19.739
[intense]
AIN'T NOBODY EVER...

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:22.108
GONNA SEE HIM...

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:25.512
AGAIN.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.647
PLUS, I'M GONNA
PUT A FANCY LITTLE HOOK IN THERE

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.315
AND TURN IT
INTO A HAT RACK.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.452
NO LET'S TAKE A LOOK
AT THIS BEDROOM.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:33.853
WHAT THE [bleep]?

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.488
- I FOUND THIS PLACE FIRST!

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.557
- FOUND IT?
MAN, I OWN THIS PLACE!

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:39.092
CAN Y'ALL GIVE ME A SECOND?

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:42.295
AAH!
[grunts, impacts]

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:43.963
YOU GONNA BITE ME, [bleep]?

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.598
I WILL CUT YOU
WITH MY SWORD CANE!

00:02:45.765 --> 00:02:48.801
AAH!

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.071
- [shuddering]

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:54.607
- SO THAT'S GONNA BE FIRST MONTH
AND LAST MONTH'S RENT

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.009
AND ONE-MONTH
SECURITY DEPOSIT.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:59.345
I'LL GET
THE PAPERWORK STARTED.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:05.852
- OKAY, BABY,
LET'S HIT THIS ROCK REAL QUICK.

